nt to the museum.\" (Tôi đã đi bảo tàng.) — \"That is a good idea!\" (Ý hay đấy!)\nTương lai: will + động từ nguyên mẫu: \"I will call you.\" Rút gọn: I'll, you'll, we'll. Phủ định: will not = won't.\nQuá khứ bất quy tắc phải học thuộc: go → went, see → saw, eat → ate, buy → bought, forget → forgot.\n\"Maybe\" (có lẽ) đứng đầu câu: \"Maybe it will rain tomorrow.\"\nRủ rê: \"Let's ...\" (Chúng ta hãy ... nhé): \"Let's have a picnic.\"","lessonId":"u16n5l4","lessonVersion":"v2.u16n5l4","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u16n5","order":124,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u16n5l4","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec2","signature":"4vJZKd68K8yXpmIngnU0GN36u0TAlmro1TnpStr4mx9yK7plx7zWAJ7SKI2dxcWhQn8lf_yPsXaVpw_fucTpDg","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["speaking","u16.grammar","u16.dialogue","u16.vocab"],"title":"Sẵn sàng chưa? · Bài 4","unitId":"u16"}